Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 13:13:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Blog: pinning, auto-filled featured post, smaller mobile
 breadcrumb

- Blog grid: render articles tagged 'pinned' first (configurable tag in
  the theme editor). Card markup extracted to snippets/drye-blog-card.liquid
  to avoid duplication.
- Featured post: remove the 'Field Report' schema defaults on the override
  fields so the existing fallback to the selected article's own title, date,
  excerpt, read time and badge actually triggers. Overrides remain optional.
- Article hero: shrink the breadcrumb on mobile (kept in DOM for SEO).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011s6BWVwQWLYmzktxBdwnCn
